{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1148","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1148/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1148/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1148/events","html_url":"https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1148","id":495324307,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0OTUzMjQzMDc=","number":1148,"title":"Can't combine brew and multiple goarm versions","user":{"login":"SimonBarendse","id":9931648,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzE2NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9931648?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse","html_url":"https://github.com/SimonBarendse","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SimonBarendse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":504976497,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1MDQ5NzY0OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2019-09-18T16:12:50Z","updated_at":"2020-11-18T22:13:27Z","closed_at":"2019-09-23T17:40:24Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\nWhen building multiple `goarm` versions and releasing on brew, an error is returned:\r\n```\r\nhomebrew tap formula: failed to publish artifacts: one tap can handle only 1 linux and 1 macos archive\r\n```\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nWe encounter this issue when releasing with [this `.goreleaser.yml`](https://github.com/secrethub/secrethub-cli/blob/v0.28.0/.goreleaser.yml). I expect anything using brew and having multiple goarm versions returns this error.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nI'd expect either one of these things:\r\n1. Nothing is added to the brew formula for ARM architectures (as was the case in goreleaser `v0.117` and earlier).\r\n2. An entry is added to the brew formula for each of the goarm versions and the formula determines which to use.\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\nGoReleaser Version: `v0.118.0` (works as expected in `v0.117.2`)\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nThe error first occurs after #1140\r\n\r\nThe error is returned [here](https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/blob/v0.118.0/internal/pipe/brew/brew.go#L278)","closed_by":{"login":"mavogel","id":8409778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDk3Nzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8409778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavogel","html_url":"https://github.com/mavogel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavogel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavogel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavogel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavogel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavogel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user